Specific changes based on your screenshots
* Replace the unrelated vertical video thumbnail with a professional product demonstration. The video can remain vertical if it is a mobile demonstration, but the desktop layout should present it intentionally.
* Remove excessive whitespace around the hero and demo. Use a balanced two-column hero on desktop.
* Increase the readability of small explanatory text.
